## Pick 3: Pavé Basket Natural — 14K Yellow Gold, $2,472

The [Marquise Diamond Accents Side Stone Engagement Ring with Pavé Basket in 14K Yellow Gold](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-diamond-accents-side-stone-engagement-ring-with-pave-basket-in-14k-yellow-gold-by-james-allen-item-316190?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) costs $1,650. The pavé basket means the stone's girdle sits inside a channel studded with small accent diamonds. It adds sparkle from every angle — not just face-up.

